{
  "schema": "loom.runtime_profile/1",
  "domain": "graph_views",
  "revision": 1,
  "description": "Graph views as data (P24): edge kinds (meaning, direction, inverse, parent kind, perspectives), node kinds, perspectives (named selections of edge kinds + node filter + depth + rendering hint, in the traversal shape of graph_perspectives: relations/direction/hops), organizational unit kinds, and the merge policy per kind of thing (view_kinds). This profile is the ROM layer; memory overlays live in <data_dir>/views/*.json (loom/effective_view.h) with the operations add, modify, hide, disable, alias and never change it. Everything is calibration, not a closed list: a kind used in data and unknown here is accepted and listed as unclassified.",
